==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*1 [[Aku Doge]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>0f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
* Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Red Malice]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>0f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

